# Line-ending normalization (UC05 § AC9 precondition).
#
# The release zip must be byte-identical across re-runs of the same tag
# (deterministic bundling). Inconsistent EOLs in the repo would taint
# hashing even when the underlying logical content is unchanged.
#
# POSIX shell + container build context: LF. PowerShell: CRLF. Mixed-
# audience text (yaml, md): LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
SandboxDockerfile text eol=lf
entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
* text=auto
